### Example requests (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP Client). Server: uvicorn app.main:app
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### 1. HTML greeting page (no token)
GET {{base}}/greeting

### 2. List own items (user A) -> 200
GET {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### 3. Filter + paginate -> 200
GET {{base}}/items?category=exam&page=1&perPage=5
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### 4. Get one item -> 200
GET {{base}}/items/item_101
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### 5. Create item -> 201
POST {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Physics quiz", "category": "exam", "date": "2026-12-10", "time": "09:30", "location": "Room 12"}

### 6. Update (replace) item -> 200
PUT {{base}}/items/item_102
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Hackathon poster (updated)", "category": "event", "date": "2026-12-06", "status": "confirmed"}

### 7. Delete item -> 200
DELETE {{base}}/items/item_102
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### ---- Failure demos ----

### 8. No token -> 401
GET {{base}}/items

### 9. Invalid token -> 401
GET {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer wrong-token

### 10. User A reads User B's item -> 404
GET {{base}}/items/item_201
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### 11. User B updates User A's item -> 404
PUT {{base}}/items/item_101
Authorization: Bearer user-b-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Hacked", "category": "task", "date": "2026-12-10"}

### 12. User B deletes User A's item -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/items/item_101
Authorization: Bearer user-b-token

### 13. Non-existent ID -> 404
GET {{base}}/items/item_999
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### 14. Validation errors -> 400
POST {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "ab", "category": "party", "date": "10-12-2026", "color": "red"}

### 15. Duplicate item -> 409
POST {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "CSCI 3509 Midterm", "category": "exam", "date": "2026-11-20"}

### 16. Unsupported method -> 405
PATCH {{base}}/items/item_101
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### ---- Administrator ----

### 17. Admin lists ALL items -> 200
GET {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### 18. Admin reads User B's item -> 200
GET {{base}}/items/item_201
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### 19. Admin updates User A's item -> 200
PUT {{base}}/items/item_101
Authorization: Bearer admin-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "CSCI 3509 Midterm (moved)", "category": "exam", "date": "2026-11-22"}

### 20. Admin deletes User B's item -> 200
DELETE {{base}}/items/item_202
Authorization: Bearer admin-token
